---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Ph from '../components/Ph.astro';
import PhoneLink from '../components/PhoneLink.astro';
import { site, copyText } from '../lib/site';
---
<Base breadcrumbs={[["Privacy Policy", "/privacy/"]]} title="Privacy Policy | Therapy & Injury" description="How Therapy & Injury collects, uses, and protects information submitted through therapyandinjury.com and its location pages.">
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="wrap">
      <span class="eyebrow">Legal</span>
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="lede">Last updated: <Ph value={site.lastUpdatedLegal} /></p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap prose">
      {copyText('privacyDraftNotice') && <p class="notice"><Ph value={copyText('privacyDraftNotice')} /></p>}

      <p>This policy explains how Therapy &amp; Injury and its locations (“we,” “us”) handle information collected through {new URL(site.domain).host} and its location pages.</p>

      <h2>Information we collect</h2>
      <p>Our appointment request form asks only for your <strong>name</strong>, <strong>phone number</strong>, <strong>preferred appointment time</strong>, the <strong>location</strong> you chose, and, if you choose to share it, the <strong>date of your accident</strong>. Please do not send medical details, insurance or claim numbers, or Social Security numbers through this website.</p>
      <p>Like most websites, our hosting provider automatically records basic technical information such as IP address, browser type, and pages visited, for security and troubleshooting.</p>

      <h2>How we use it</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>To contact you about your appointment request by phone or text.</li>
        <li>To operate, secure, and improve this website.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>We do not sell your information. We do not use it for advertising profiles.</p>

      <h2>Who we share it with</h2>
      <p>Only service providers that help us run this website and respond to your request {copyText('privacyProviders') ? <Fragment>(for example, our web host and email provider: <Ph value={copyText('privacyProviders')} />)</Fragment> : '(for example, our web host and email provider)'}, or when required by law.</p>

      <h2>Cookies, analytics, and third-party content</h2>
      <p>This website does not use advertising cookies. {site.seo.gaMeasurementId ? <Fragment>We use Google Analytics to understand which pages are visited, in aggregate; it never receives what you type into our forms.</Fragment> : <Fragment>We do not currently use analytics.</Fragment>} If you tap “Use my location,” your browser shares your position with the page only to work out which of our locations is closest; it is not sent to us or anyone else, and the page remembers only which location was closest, on your device. Location pages include an embedded Google Map; Google may collect information when the map loads under <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" rel="noopener" target="_blank">Google’s Privacy Policy<span class="sr-only"> (opens in a new tab)</span></a>.</p>

      <h2>Online booking, forms, and patient portal</h2>
      <p>Online appointment booking, new patient paperwork, and our patient portal are provided by Carepatron, a third-party practice management and electronic health record service. Information you enter there is collected and protected under Carepatron’s security practices and our agreement with them, and is used to provide your care.</p>

      <h2>Your health information</h2>
      <p>Once you become a patient, your health information is protected under federal and Florida law and our {/^https?:\/\//.test(copyText('privacyNoticeUrl')) ? <a href={copyText('privacyNoticeUrl')} rel="noopener" target="_blank">Notice of Privacy Practices<span class="sr-only"> (opens in a new tab)</span></a> : <Fragment>Notice of Privacy Practices <Ph value={copyText('privacyNoticeUrl')} /></Fragment>}. This website policy covers only information submitted through the website.</p>

      <h2>Security and retention</h2>
      <p>We use reasonable safeguards, including encrypted (HTTPS) connections. We keep appointment requests only as long as needed to respond and as required by law. <Ph value={copyText('privacyRetention')} /></p>

      <h2>Children</h2>
      <p>This website is not directed to children under 13. A parent or guardian should request appointments for minors.</p>

      <h2>Contact us</h2>
      <p>Questions about this policy: <Ph value={site.mainEmail} /> or <PhoneLink />.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
